          "text": "Témoignages: COLOMIERS (31) 09.10.2025",
          "text_sha256": "c0770d69c6fb4beecad51fdb9a456ceb79ff939d5bcb4286f5589ad195f8c9ef"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
